---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="About" description="Five-time CTO looking for co-founders. What I've built and what I'm looking for.">
  <div class="col prose">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      I'm Guillaume Balaine, a software engineer from Paris. I've been CTO of five startups and built about ten products
      from scratch.
    </p>

    <!-- TODO: replace with your real story. Keep it concrete: companies, what you built, what happened. -->
    <h2>What I've done</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>CTO, five times. <em>TODO: list the companies, one line each: what it did and what you built.</em></li>
      <li>Principal engineer at Adikteev. <em>TODO: one line on the work.</em></li>
      <li>About ten products shipped from scratch. <em>TODO: link the two or three you're proudest of.</em></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>
      I get new startup ideas all the time, and I build a working prototype of the good ones quickly. Instead of keeping
      them in a notes app, I publish them here, each with the prototype, why I think now is the moment, and what it
      would take to turn it into a company.
    </p>

    <h2>Who I want to hear from</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Founders with domain knowledge, customers or distribution, looking for a technical co-founder.</li>
      <li>Investors and angels who meet strong non-technical founders.</li>
      <li>People inside the industries I write about, who can tell me what I've got wrong.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Write to me at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  em {
    color: var(--graphite);
  }
</style>
